WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:21.428
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.429 --> 00:00:25.762
I'm a hippopotamus.

3
00:00:25.763 --> 00:00:30.519
Many people just call us hippos.

4
00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:35.296
We're very big land mammals.

5
00:00:35.297 --> 00:00:38.569
Where do you live?

6
00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.049
Hippos live in Africa.

7
00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:47.538
We stay near swamps, lakes, and rivers.

8
00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:51.148
Do you like the water?

9
00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:56.804
Yes. Hippos spend almost all day in the water.

10
00:00:56.805 --> 00:01:00.449
The water keeps us cool.

11
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:04.614
We even sleep in shallow water.

12
00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:08.777
Are you a good swimmer?

13
00:01:08.778 --> 00:01:14.297
Hippos are very heavy.

14
00:01:14.298 --> 00:01:17.971
We don't float.

15
00:01:17.972 --> 00:01:22.541
So we often just walk through the water.

16
00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:25.536
What do you eat?

17
00:01:25.537 --> 00:01:29.483
Hippos eat grasses.

18
00:01:29.484 --> 00:01:34.733
We usually wait until the hot sun sets.

19
00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:39.401
Then we leave the water to find food.

20
00:01:39.402 --> 00:01:47.997
You have a huge mouth!

21
00:01:47.998 --> 00:01:53.710
Our jaws can open very wide.

22
00:01:53.711 --> 00:01:58.836
Our bottom teeth are long—and sharp!

23
00:01:58.837 --> 00:02:04.258
We use them to fight.

24
00:02:04.259 --> 00:02:08.911
Oh! Do you have many enemies?

25
00:02:08.912 --> 00:02:13.502
We're too big to have many enemies.

26
00:02:13.503 --> 00:02:24.243
But people often hunt us.

27
00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:27.555
I'm getting hot again.

28
00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:31.716
Back in the water!

29
00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:39.709
Bye, Hippopotamus!
